OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe odd isolated, possibly
OL,6,Fheavy shower is expected through the
OL,7,Fday, mostly across the north and west
OL,8,Fof the country. Most other places
OL,9,Fstaying dry with sunny spells.
OL,10,FTemperatures around, or just below
OL,11,Faverage for the time of year.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FMostly dry at first this
OL,14,Fevening, but showers will move in
OL,15,Facross the country from the west
OL,16,Fovernight, heavy at times. Winds
OL,17,Fmostly gentle, with some clear spells.
OL,18,FFeeling cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
