OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FShowers will continue to
OL,6,Ffeed in from the north on Thursday,
OL,7,Fwhich could turn thundery at times.
OL,8,FShowers turning lighter and more
OL,9,Fisolated through the afternoon.
OL,10,FSlightly cooler than Tuesday.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:
OL,13,FTemperatures staying below average
OL,14,Finto the weekend. Scattered showers
OL,15,Fcontinuing on Friday, but slowly
OL,16,Fbecoming more settled again heading
OL,17,Finto the weekend with an increasing
OL,18,Fnumber of sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
